WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:01.850
1857.

2
00:00:01.900 --> 00:00:04.050
A fort gateway at night.

3
00:00:04.100 --> 00:00:07.320
An iron box passes from hand to hand.

4
00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:08.620
A rajah.

5
00:00:08.670 --> 00:00:11.920
Four men at a gate, who
hide it in the fort.

6
00:00:11.970 --> 00:00:15.690
Two officers on a prison
island, who buy the secret.

7
00:00:15.740 --> 00:00:17.310
A dying major.

8
00:00:17.360 --> 00:00:18.650
His sons.

9
00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.120
Everyone wants it.

10
00:00:20.170 --> 00:00:22.370
But who really deserves it?

11
00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:25.160
In this mission, you'll
follow the treasure's journey,

12
00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:27.930
from Agra fort all the way to London.

13
00:00:27.980 --> 00:00:32.860
You'll hear a dying man confess to "The
cursed greed which has been my besetting

14
00:00:32.910 --> 00:00:34.500
sin through life".

15
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:37.850
And you'll hear each
claimant's case: the four men,

16
00:00:37.900 --> 00:00:40.740
the officers, and Mary Morstan.

17
00:00:40.790 --> 00:00:44.600
Your mission: decide who has
the best right to the treasure.
